# TypeScript

- Imports at the top of the module. No inline imports in function bodies, type positions, or interface fields unless a circular dependency is documented at the import.
- `switch` on discriminated unions or enums: handle every variant and `default` with a `never` check so new variants fail compile.
- Prefer explicit types on exported functions and GraphQL client results.
- Do not add a second UI kit besides shadcn/ui + Tailwind.
